Package: ckan-linux
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libbrotli1, libbz2-1.0,
 libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libglib2.0-0, libgraphite2-3, libharfbuzz0b,
 libice6, liblzma5, libpng16-16, libsm6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxml2
Maintainer: CKAN Linux contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/appaKappaK/CKAN-LinuxUI
Description: Linux desktop mod manager for Kerbal Space Program
 CKAN Linux is an Avalonia desktop client for browsing, installing, updating,
 and removing Kerbal Space Program mods from the CKAN catalog.
